# Build contexts are the repository root. This is an allowlist: everything is
# excluded unless it is listed below, so secrets and build outputs can never
# end up in an image layer.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!sidecar/

**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.cdx.json
**/.env
